      "content": "Can you help me parse some agglutinative forms from a dataset I'm working on? I need a breakdown of the root and the suffixes for these three words, and specifically if there's any vowel harmony or stem changes happening:\n\n1. talossani\n2. kotoissamme\n3. metsittäin",
